#, fuzzy
msgid "To migrate from 2.14, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.15[our migration guide]."
msgstr "要从2.14迁移，请参考 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.15[我们的迁移指南] 。"

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus 2.15 brings support for https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/new-accelerate-your-lambda-functions-with-lambda-snapstart/[AWS Lambda SnapStart]."
msgstr "Quarkus 2.15带来了对 link:https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/new-accelerate-your-lambda-functions-with-lambda-snapstart/[AWS Lambda SnapStart] 的支持。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This has already been announced in details in https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-support-for-aws-lambda-snapstart/[a previous blog post]."
msgstr "这在 link:https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-support-for-aws-lambda-snapstart/[之前的一篇博文] 中已经详细公布了。"

msgid "See https://quarkus.io/guides/aws-lambda-snapstart[the dedicated guide] for more information about how to use AWS Lambda SnapStart with Quarkus."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "New gRPC implementation"
msgstr "新的gRPC实现"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The gRPC extension has been rewritten to use a new Vert.x-based gRPC implementation."
msgstr "gRPC扩展已被重写，以使用新的基于Vert.x的gRPC实现。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Moreover `@InjectMock` is now working for gRPC Mutiny clients."
msgstr "此外， `@InjectMock` ，现在可以为gRPC Mutiny客户端工作。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The SmallRye GraphQL extension now supports enhancing your GraphQL API with metadata needed to be able to expose it via a Apollo Federation gateway.\n"
"This is achieved via annotations in the `io.smallrye.graphql.api.federation` package.\n"
"See https://www.apollographql.com/docs/federation/ for general information about Federation or https://smallrye.io/smallrye-graphql/2.0.0/federation/ for an example."
msgstr "SmallRye GraphQL 扩展现在支持使用元数据增强 GraphQL API，以便能够通过阿波罗联盟网关公开该 API。这可以通过 `io.smallrye.graphql.api.federation` 软件包中的注解来实现。有关 Federation 的一般信息， link:https://www.apollographql.com/docs/federation/[请参见 https://www.apollographql.com/docs/federation/] ；有关示例，请 link:https://www.apollographql.com/docs/federation/[参见] https://smallrye.io/smallrye-graphql/2.0.0/federation/ 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Redis - Search group"
msgstr "Redis - 搜索组"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Since the introduction of the new Redis extension, a lot of new commands were added from version to version."
msgstr "自从引入新的Redis扩展后，各版本都增加了很多新的命令。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It is now commands for the search group which makes its apparition in Quarkus."
msgstr "现在是搜索组的命令，它在夸库斯出现。"

msgid "<code>@ClientQueryParam</code> for Reactive REST Client"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Using the Reactive REST Client, it is possible to add query parameters to a request with the `@ClientQueryParam` annotation."
msgstr "使用Reactive REST客户端，可以用 `@ClientQueryParam` 注释向请求添加查询参数。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It is described in details in https://quarkus.io/guides/rest-client-reactive#using-clientqueryparam[the Reactive REST Client guide]."
msgstr "在 link:https://quarkus.io/guides/rest-client-reactive#using-clientqueryparam[Reactive REST Client指南] 中对它进行了详细描述。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Filtering by named queries in REST Data with Panache extension"
msgstr "用Panache扩展在REST数据中通过命名查询进行过滤"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Filtering by named queries has been added to the REST Data with Panache extension."
msgstr "在REST Data with Panache扩展中加入了通过命名查询进行过滤的功能。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can find more information about it in https://quarkus.io/guides/rest-data-panache#complex-filtering-to-list-entities-using-namedquery[the REST Data with Panache guide]."
msgstr "你可以在 link:https://quarkus.io/guides/rest-data-panache#complex-filtering-to-list-entities-using-namedquery[REST Data with Panache指南] 中找到更多相关信息。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "OIDC FrontChannel logout"
msgstr "OIDC FrontChannel注销"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The OIDC extension adds support for OIDC FrontChannel logout."
msgstr "OIDC扩展增加了对OIDC FrontChannel注销的支持。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hibernate ORM - IN clause parameter padding enabled by default"
msgstr "Hibernate ORM - 默认启用IN子句的参数填充"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus 2.15 adds the `quarkus.hibernate-orm.query.in-clause-parameter-padding` configuration property to the Hibernate ORM extension,\n"
"and enables it by default."
msgstr "Quarkus 2.15 在 Hibernate ORM 扩展中添加了 `quarkus.hibernate-orm.query.in-clause-parameter-padding` 配置属性，并在默认情况下启用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It improves the caching of queries containing IN clauses."
msgstr "它改善了包含IN子句的查询的缓存。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "CLI improvements"
msgstr "CLI改进"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Two major improvements for the Quarkus CLI in 2.15:"
msgstr "2.15版Quarkus CLI有两项重大改进。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Continuous testing is available in the Quarkus CLI with the `quarkus test` command."
msgstr "在Quarkus CLI中可以通过 `quarkus test` 命令进行连续测试。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Building and pushing images is as simple as `quarkus image build` / `quarkus image push`."
msgstr "建立和推送图像就像 `quarkus image build` / `quarkus image push` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "-XX:ArchiveClassesAtExit for AppCDS creation"
msgstr "-XX:ArchiveClassesAtExit用于创建AppCDS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "When using Java 17+ to create AppCDS archives, Quarkus automatically enables the `-XX:ArchiveClassesAtExit` option."
msgstr "当使用Java 17+来创建AppCDS档案时，Quarkus会自动启用 `-XX:ArchiveClassesAtExit` 选项。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Dev Services for Kubernetes"
msgstr "Kubernetes 开发服务"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dev Services is one of the Dev Experience features that make Quarkus unique.\n"
"Quarkus 2.15 introduces Dev Services for Kubernetes so that you can easily test your applications using the Kubernetes Client extension."
msgstr "开发服务是 Quarkus 独特的开发体验功能之一。Quarkus 2.15 为 Kubernetes 引入了 Dev Services，这样你就可以使用 Kubernetes 客户端扩展轻松测试应用程序。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Test framework for Google Cloud Functions"
msgstr "谷歌云功能的测试框架"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The Google Cloud Functions extensions now have a test framework utility in the form of the `quarkus-test-google-cloud-functions` artifact."
msgstr "谷歌云功能扩展现在有一个测试框架工具，其形式是 `quarkus-test-google-cloud-functions` artifact。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can find more information about it in https://quarkus.io/guides/funqy-gcp-functions#testing-your-function[the Google Cloud Functions guide]."
msgstr "你可以在 link:https://quarkus.io/guides/funqy-gcp-functions#testing-your-function[谷歌云功能指南] 中找到关于它的更多信息。"

